<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel is intensifying airstrikes and artillery against Hezbollah positions in southern Lebanon, while Hezbollah monitors Israeli naval forces from Lebanese fishing boats. The Lebanese prime minister says a proposal is under way to keep UNIFIL operating beyond the end of the year to avoid a security vacuum as the force prepares to withdraw. Lebanon fears Israel may impose a maritime buffer zone in its southern waters, and France is planning a phased withdrawal of international forces after UNIFIL leaves. The conflict has caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOcURSVjBueElPZG5YRXpxUl9MRzNpbHhEQ3hOUFVpNE1YcFlmZWl0enVZTlNiRTEzZjFPal94OXZkaTcyQmllSjlvTjZLV2ZDRE1uRnhDYTRibmRVSTNlNGFwVVJnM3pXeTdsbEpMUzFGNjNXUXIzU2U2NTZJNnVHRy02cW4yTEJPMFlWTDdWaG1Gakw2MXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breakingthenews.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOVjRfZ3IxYUROSUVvUzBNTEEtanpvaFBQT0ZRLVN4WkhWV3dON2J5RUJKMVVrNThCMUZDbkwxaVVoVnNWNkVhdHB6MDdiSnRXVVBRRHVTR284cHVmYjVQdW5kdHoyQUt2QzRITENWbUFNS2ZPSXlNd1lQVmFMWXZQNGsydUFVSjkxNTYzMXdrc1ozSmR0R2R5ZGRVMUgzUTlDT2s2N0VfSVlWQU1VRENLRmNSRnlMZlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsCord&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNekwyZFp4SGh0aUZ0aGpPejY3UkFOdEwyOEY2S3FQOVFCVTVTb1JtVzhTQ0VURGtUMWh4aVc4SlJ0eEJMenI3cGgxNl84V2FMcWt6R1JINGpOMDdLazBnMm55dk5UOUplSkFtNUpnMXVDMmxPZVNXSGNacU1RaC16dXdfX21xbFRyVGpkOTZNWldYcWo5VGJXQmt2ekRTdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABN